    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCARY MAGIC ZOMBIE is a short first-person horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil scientists have created a SCARY MAGIC ZOMBIE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a secret spy, who enters the facility, and must collect information about this zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out! The SCARY MAGIC ZOMBIE is extremely dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be very careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is very simple. You walk through the facility, and use the left mouse click button to open doors and pick up documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the player camera with the mouse, and use the WASD keys to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD keys for movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mouse movement for camera control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >left mouse click to interact with game objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESCAPE key to open and close the pause menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB key to view the current game objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F key to toggle the flashlight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed for people who enjoy short, suspenseful, frightening experiences, with a highly immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average completion time: 10-20 minutes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCARY MAGIC ZOMBIE is a short first-person horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil scientists have created a SCARY MAGIC ZOMBIE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a secret spy, who enters the facility, and must collect information about this zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out! The SCARY MAGIC ZOMBIE is extremely dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be very careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is very simple. You walk through the facility, and use the left mouse click button to open doors and pick up documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the player camera with the mouse, and use the WASD keys to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD keys for movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mouse movement for camera control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >left mouse click to interact with game objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESCAPE key to open and close the pause menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB key to view the current game objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F key to toggle the flashlight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed for people who enjoy short, suspenseful, frightening experiences, with a highly immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average completion time: 10-20 minutes.</p>",
    "short_description": "EVIL SCIENTISTS have created a SCARY MAGIC ZOMBIE! Play as a top secret spy, who enters the zombie facility, and collects information about the zombie. But be cautious! The zombie is very dangerous!",
